Crowdstrike Falcon: A cloud based platform designed to protect critical areas of business risk. It includes endpoints, cloud workloads, identity and data.
  It uses its built in AI to help deliver very acurate detections, protection and remediation.
  Source: https://www.crowdstrike.com/en-us/platform/
Microsoft Sentinel: A cloud based security information and event management solution. Sentinel allows analysts to anticipate and stop attacks across the cloud. 
  Source: http://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/sentinel/overview?tabs=defender-portal
IBM QRadar: Utilises User Behaviour Analytics to establish a behaviour baseline for employees to better detect threats. It also analyses network activity in real time to deliver
  actionable insights to effectively respond to problems with the network.
  Source: https://www.ibm.com/products/qradar
SentinelOne: Offers AI-supported security solutions, providing protection across endpoints, the cloud and identities. Real-time AI detection helps respond to 
  secure against threats quickly and accurately.
  Source: https://www.sentinelone.com/?utm_content=chatbot
Snyk: Designed to enhance productivity while reducing business risk. It makes software delivery more secure, and quicker.
  Source: https://snyk.io/
